{"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Users sometimes need to restore purchased content, such as when they upgrade to a new phone. Include some mechanism in your app, such as a Restore Purchases button, to let them restore their purchases."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Refresh the app receipt","anchor":"Refresh-the-app-receipt","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A request to the App Store to get the app receipt, which represents the user’s transactions with your app."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The receipt isn’t necessary if you use StoreKit2. Only use the receipt if your app supports deployment target is lower than iOS 15.0, tvOS 15.0, watchOS 8.0, macOS 12.0."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this API to request a new app receipt from the App Store if the receipt is invalid or missing from its expected location. To request the receipt using the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/flare.Flare\/documentation\/Flare\/IFlare\/receipt(completion:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The receipt refresh request displays a system prompt that asks users to authenticate with their App Store credentials. For a better user experience, initiate the request after an explicit user action, like tapping or clicking a button.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"important"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Flare.shared.receipt { result in ","    switch result {","    case let .success(receipt):","        \/\/ Handle a receipt","    case let .failure(error):","        \/\/ Handle an error","    }","}"]},{"name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a 